  "Storm Prelude/\\nPiercing Chill Lv.$1": "",
  "Storm Prelude/\\nPiercing Chill <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to 1 foe $1 times, with a $3 base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|105\"><u>Windswept</u></link>; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally inflict <link\\=\"s|209\"><u>Wind Injury</u></link> for $4 turns. Increase Kotone's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> when attacking foes with <link\\=\"s|209\"><u>Wind Injury</u></link>.\\n[Winter Night Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>. If they are already inflicted with <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>, inflict <link\\=\"s|210\"><u>Freezing</u></link> for $8 turns. Foes with <link\\=\"s|210\"><u>Freezing</u></link> increase Ice DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>When they fall from the sky, they turn into spring hurricanes or winter blizzards.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Sweeping Wind/\\nFalling Snowfield Lv.$1": "",
  "Sweeping Wind/\\nFalling Snowfield <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to all foes $1 times; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 2 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>.\\n[Winter Night Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK Ice damage to all foes, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the damage of this attack by $5.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Whether it's mid-spring or the dead of winter, the wind will be there, and whether it's a spring seed or a cold snowfall, the wind will clear the way and help you move forward.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Coming of Spring/\\nCold Night Song Lv.$1": "",
  "Coming of Spring/\\nCold Night Song <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: Open [Mid-Spring Domain] for 1 turn, then deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to 1 foe $1 times. When [Mid-Spring Domain] is active, all allies when dealing Wind damage with Persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>, Kotone will deal $3 ATK Wind damage to the main target and gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>. When [Mid-Spring Domain] ends, spend all <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> and deal (4+<link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>)*<color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK Wind damage to the main target, this damage is seen as a <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.\\n[Winter Night Form]: Open [Winter Night Domain] for 1 turn, then deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> Ice damage to 1 foe. When [Winter Night Domain] is active, all allies gain [Condensed Shield] when attacked which give <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Shield, up to $7 times; All allies when dealing Ice damage with Persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>, Kotone will gain 1 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link>. When [Winter Night Domain] ends, spend all <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> and deal (4+<link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link>)*<color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> ATK Ice damage to the main target, this damage is seen as a <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The whirling dance is like a prayer for the spring to come and lift you up to fly, and for the cold nights to go away and send them away.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: [Mid-Spring Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK to 1 foe $1 times; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap; Otherwise deal 1 additional hit of Wind damage to the target. [Winter Night Form]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>Ice Seal</u></link> for 1 turn; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the base chance of <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>Ice Seal</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>; Otherwise increase <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $6. \\n[ONE MORE]: [Mid-Spring Form]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe. [Winter Night Form]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "Cherish Lv.$1": "",
  "If a Wind ally is in the party, increase {{A}}'s Wind DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>; If an Ice ally is in the party, increase {{A}}'s Ice DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "If a Wind ally is in the party, increase {{A}}'s Wind DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>; If an Ice ally is in the party, increase {{A}}'s Ice DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>.": "",
  "Longing Lv.$1": "",
  "Under [Mid-Spring Form], when allies deal $1 hit of Wind damage, increase the ATK for all allies by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns, up to $4 stacks; Under [Winter Night Domain], when Kotone gains a Shield, increase the DEF for all allies by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns, up to $7 stacks.": "",
  "Under [Mid-Spring Form], when allies deal $1 hit of Wind damage, increase the ATK for all allies by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> for $3 turns, up to $4 stacks; Under [Winter Night Domain], when Kotone gains a Shield, increase the DEF for all allies by <color\\=#0169ca>$5</color> for $6 turns, up to $7 stacks.": "",
  "After using [Coming of Spring/Cold Night Song], immediately gain $1 [Morning Dew Crystal]/[Frost Crystal].\\nWhen [Mid-Spring Domain]/[Winter Night Domain] is active, after other Wind/Ice allies use a {{A}} skill/HIGHLIGHT/{{B}}, Kotone gains $2 [Morning Dew Crystal]/[Frost Crystal] that exceed the maximum limit. Stacks up to $3 times.\\nWhen [Mid-Spring Domain]/[Winter Night Domain] is active, increase Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.": "",
  "After using [Coming of Spring/Cold Night Song], immediately gain $1 [Morning Dew Crystal]/[Frost Crystal].\\nWhen [Mid-Spring Domain]/[Winter Night Domain] is active, after other Wind/Ice allies use a {{A}} skill/HIGHLIGHT/{{B}}, Kotone gains $2 [Morning Dew Crystal]/[Frost Crystal] that exceed the maximum limit. Stacks up to $3 times.\\nWhen [Mid-Spring Domain]/[Winter Night Domain] is active, increase Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color>.": "",
  "When Kotone spends [Morning Dew Crystal]/[Frost Crystal], for each stack spent, additionally increase Follow Up Skill Damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Kotone's Awareness level * $2 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> + Kotone's Awareness level * $4).\\nDecrease Kotone's SP cost by $5.": "",
