  "<size\\=22>Spring Pond and Burnout Swan</size>": "",
  "{{A}} has 2 Forms: [Mid-Spring Form] and [Winter Night Form]. {{A}} can freely change Form when [Mid-Spring Domain]/[Winter Night Domain] is not opened. Gain the respective skills when changing Form. At the start of battle, start in [Mid-Spring Form], but if there are more Ice Thieves than Wind Thieves, start in [Winter Night Form].\\nFor every <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> or <link\\=\"s\\|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> stack she gains, permanently increase ATK by $1 (stacks up to $2 times).": "",
  "Elegy of Water": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: Gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> every time Kotone open [Mid-Spring Domain]; Increase <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> damage by $1 for every <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> when [Mid-Spring Domain] ends (Up to $2).\\n[Winter Night Form]: Gain 1 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> every time Kotone opens [Winter Night Domain]; Increase <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> damage by $3 for every <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> when [Winter Night Domain] ends (Up to $4).": "",
  "<size\\=23>Poem of Time and Sigh of Wind</size>": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: When [Mid-Spring Domain] is active, decrease the DEF for all foes by $1 and reduce the SP cost for all allies by $2.\\n[Winter Night Form]: When [Winter Night Domain] is active, increase the Ice DMG for all allies by $3 and decrease Kotone's SP cost by $4.": "",
  "Dancing with Ripple Light and Feathers": "",
  "Dream-Like Spin": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: When using HIGHLIGHT. if Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap; Otherwise increase the damage of this HIGHLIGHT by $1. \\n[Winter Night Form]: When using HIGHLIGHT. if Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], additionally gain 1 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap; Otherwise increase the damage of this HIGHLIGHT by $2.": "",
  "Finale Beyond Life": "",
  "Fate-Defying Soul": "",
  "[Mid-Spring Form]: After triggering the <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> when [Mid-Spring Domain] ends, extend [Mid-Spring Domain] by $1 turn then refund $2 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> and $3 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap, Kotone can trigger the <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> again; When [Mid-Spring Domain] ends, for every <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>, increase the Pierce of <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> by $4 (Up to $5).\\n[Winter Night Form]: After triggering the <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> when [Winter Night Domain] ends, extend [Winter Night Domain] by $6 turn then refund $7 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> and $8 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap, Kotone can trigger the <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> again; When [Winter Night Domain] ends, for every <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link>, increase the Pierce of <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link> by $9 (Up to $10).": "",
  "Deal $2 ATK Wind damage to <color\\=#FFFC40>1</color> foe $1 times, with a $3 base chance to inflict Windswept; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 [Morning Dew Crystal] and inflict Wind Injury for $4 turns. Increase Kotone's Crit DMG by $5 when attacking foes with Wind Injury.": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to 1 foe $1 times, with a $3 base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|105\"><u>Windswept</u></link>; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 [Morning Dew Crystal] and inflict <link\\=\"s|209\"><u>Wind Injury</u></link> for $4 turns. Increase Kotone's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> when attacking foes with <link\\=\"s|209\"><u>Wind Injury</u></link>.": "",
  "Deal $2 ATK Wind damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes $1 times; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 2 [Morning Dew Crystal].": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to all foes $1 times; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 2 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>.": "",
  "Open [Mid-Spring Domain] for 1 turn, then deal $2 ATK Wind damage to <color\\=#FFFC40>1</color> foe $1 times. When [Mid-Spring Domain] is active, all allies when dealing Wind damage with Persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or Follow Up, Kotone will deal $3 ATK Wind damage to the <color\\=#FFFF00>main target</color> and gain 1 [Morning Dew Crystal]. When [Mid-Spring Domain] ends, spend all [Morning Dew Crystal] and deal (4+[Morning Dew Crystal])*$4 ATK Wind damage to the main target, this damage is seen as a Follow Up.": "",
  "Open [Mid-Spring Domain] for 1 turn, then deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Wind damage to 1 foe $1 times. When [Mid-Spring Domain] is active, all allies when dealing Wind damage with Persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>, Kotone will deal $3 ATK Wind damage to the main target and gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>. When [Mid-Spring Domain] ends, spend all <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> and deal (4+<link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link>)*<color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK Wind damage to the main target, this damage is seen as a <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK to 1 foe $1 times; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 <link\\=\"s|212\"><u>[Morning Dew Crystal]</u></link> that can exceed the cap; Otherwise deal 1 additional hit of Wind damage to the target. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Uses a gun to shoot 1 foe. dealing Gun damage, can shoot multiple times based on ammo.": "",
  "Deal $2 ATK Wind damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe; If Kotone is in [Mid-Spring Domain], additionally gain 1 [Morning Dew Crystal] that can exceed the cap; Otherwise deal 1 additional hit of Wind damage to the target.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFC40>1</color> foe, with a $2 base chance to inflict Freeze. If they are already inflicted with Freeze, inflict Freezing for $3 turns. Foes with Freezing increase Ice DMG Taken by $4.": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>. If they are already inflicted with <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>, inflict <link\\=\"s|210\"><u>Freezing</u></link> for $3 turns. Foes with <link\\=\"s|210\"><u>Freezing</u></link> increase Ice DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFC40>all</color> foes, with a $2 base chance to inflict Freeze; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the damage of this attack by $3.": "",
  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to all foes, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link>; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the damage of this ATK by $3.": "",
  "Open [Winter Night Domain] for 1 turn, then deal $1 ATK Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFC40>1</color> foe. When [Winter Night Domain] is active, <color\\=#FFFF00>all allies</color> gain [Condensed Shield] when attacked which give $2 Shield, up to $3 times; All allies when dealing Ice damage with Persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or Follow Up, Kotone will gain 1 [Frost Crystal]. When [Winter Night Domain] ends, spend all [Frost Crystal] and deal (4+[Frost Crystal])*$4 ATK Ice damage to the <color\\=#FFFF00>main</color> target, this damage is seen as a Follow Up.": "",
  "Open [Winter Night Domain] for 1 turn, then deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe. When [Winter Night Domain] is active, all allies gain [Condensed Shield] when attacked which give <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield, up to $3 times; All allies when dealing Ice damage with persona skill, HIGHLIGHT, {{C}}, or <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>, Kotone will gain 1 <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link>. When [Winter Night Domain] ends, spend all <link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link> and deal (4+<link\\=\"s|213\"><u>[Frost Crystal]</u></link>)*<color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK Ice damage to the main target, this damage is seen as a <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Ice damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe, with a $2 base chance to inflict them with [Ice Seal] for 1 turn; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the base chance of [Ice Seal] by $3; Otherwise increase the damage dealt by this ATK by $4.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>Ice Seal</u></link> for 1 turn; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the base chance of <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>Ice Seal</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>; Otherwise increase the damage dealt by this ATK by $4. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Uses a gun to shoot 1 foe. dealing Gun damage, can shoot multiple times based on ammo.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> for 1 turn; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the base chance of <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>; Otherwise increase the damage dealt by this ATK by $4. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Uses a gun to shoot 1 foe. dealing Gun damage, can shoot multiple times based on ammo.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Ice damage to 1 foe, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> for 1 turn; If Kotone is in [Winter Night Domain], increase the base chance of <link\\=\"s|214\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>; Otherwise increase <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $4. \\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Uses a gun to shoot 1 foe. dealing Gun damage, can shoot multiple times based on ammo.": "",
